\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\tab JESUS,  united by thy grace
\par \pard\li720 And each to each endeared,
\par With confidence we seek Thy face,
\par And know our prayer is heard.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab Still let us own our common Lord,
\par \pard\li720 And bear Thine easy yoke,
\par A band of love, a threefold cord,
\par Which never can be broke.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab Make us into one spirit drink ;
\par \pard\li720 Baptize into Thy name ;
\par And let us always kindly think
\par And sweetly speak the same.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab Touched by the loadstone of Thy love,
\par \pard\li720 Let all our hearts agree,
\par And ever toward each other move,
\par And ever move toward Thee.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.\tab To Thee, inseparably joined,
\par \pard\li720 Let all our spirits cleave ;
\par O may we all the loving mind
\par That was in Thee receive.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.\tab This is the bond of perfectness,
\par \pard\li720 Thy spotless charity ;
\par O let us, still we pray, possess
\par The mind that was in Thee,
\par Amen.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

